{"title":"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 37","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A man has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/9/2894f4da40ae196bb727e51266f683bbb3d07364.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$3000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> invested at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/e/8de1a36d69a7028480a87b712a7141c651398a06.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/5/0/d50502cbce1894e06cd3f7651e7f33c87380065f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$2000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"14\" /> at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/2/5/125a370ce224f465362ebc7c964239cef63aee6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(x+1)\\%.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"74\" height=\"18\" /> The annual interest on the investments totals <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/3/9f3537a5a1cbd102ef9efa8be6b35b21463dfde9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\$220.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" /> Find the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> rate.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/a/7faa9f317114019c98473d66b3022a50bd023d22.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{(A)} \\quad 2\\% \\quad \\text{(B)} \\quad 4\\% \\quad \\text{(C)} \\quad 3\\frac{1}{2}\\% \\quad \\text{(D)} \\quad 5\\% \\quad \\text{(E) NOTA}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"421\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Plug in each of the answer choices. We see that the right answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/3/a53d27d9b3277ee74927ed8daec2257efe927062.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\text{(B)}}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"43\" height=\"30\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/f/16fc6efc34767ce8df64f986b6887d400b5fa685.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[100(4/3000)+(5/2000)=220\\]\" width=\"236\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_37&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contests\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests\">1963 TMTA High School Mathematics Contests</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problems\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problems\">Problems</a>)</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_36\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 36\"> Problem 36</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"40%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=TMTA_High_School_Mathematics_Contest_Past_Problems/Solutions\" title=\"TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions\">TMTA High School Mathematics Contest Past Problems/Solutions</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"30%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1963_TMTA_High_School_Algebra_I_Contest_Problem_38\" title=\"1963 TMTA High School Algebra I Contest Problem 38\">Problem 38</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017185653\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.013 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 74/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 661/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 305/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1721/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.662      1 Template:Succession_box\n100.00%    7.662      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:20683:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017185653 and revision id 144658. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}